<p id="S5.SS1.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Stability metrics: <math id="S5.SS1.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math>=2.21%, range=5.3%, demonstrating measurement
variance consistent with the baseline condition.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.F3" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.25933v1/Moving_avarage.jpeg" id="S5.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/256;" width="429" height="256" alt="Refer to caption">
