<p id="Sx1.p19.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Sx1.p19.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[20] Google (2025). </span><em id="Sx1.p19.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Gemini API Pricing.</em><span id="Sx1.p19.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><a href="https://ai.google.dev/pricing" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">https://ai.google.dev/pricing</a><span id="Sx1.p19.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="Sx1.p20" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
