<p id="A1.SS11.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS11.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Key Finding</span><span id="A1.SS11.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">: Base Phi-3.5-instruct shows minimal,
non-significant improvement with scaffolding alone (+3.5 pp from 55.0%
baseline, p=0.08), demonstrating that small models require fine-tuning
to benefit from cognitive scaffolds.</span></p>
</div>
</section>
