<section id="A1.SS15.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph" style="font-size:90%;">Key observations</h5>

<div id="A1.SS15.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A1.I15" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I15.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I15.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I15.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I15.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Most Agreement:</span><span id="A1.I15.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Claude judge (73.8% agreement between
models)</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I15.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;padding-top:0.0pt;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I15.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I15.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I15.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Least Agreement:</span><span id="A1.I15.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Gemini judge (59.2% agreement between
models)</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I15.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;padding-top:0.0pt;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I15.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I15.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I15.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Spread:</span><span id="A1.I15.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> 14.6% difference between most and least agreeable
judges</span></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS16" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.16 </span>Statistical Validation (McNemar Tests)</h3>

<div id="A1.SS16.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS16.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS16.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">To validate that the observed differences between models are not
statistically significant, we conducted McNemar’s test for each judge
independently:</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T14" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T14.2" class="ltx_tabular">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T14.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T14.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T14.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:54.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T14.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.T14.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Judge</span></span>
</span></th>
