<section id="A1.SS25" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.25 </span>Inter-Judge Agreement (Unanimity) Progression</h3>

<div id="A1.SS25.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS25.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS25.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">How consistent are the judges as the sample size grows?</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T23" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T23.2" class="ltx_tabular">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
