<p id="A1.I44.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I44.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Detailed per-model cost notes correspond to Section 6 table;
spreadsheet and parameters available on request.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
